      "devanagari": "यन्न शक्यम् सुरैः सर्वैरसुरैर्वा महाबलैः\nमोक्तुम् तद् बन्धनम् घोरं यक्षगन्धर्वपन्नगैः |\nतन्न जाने प्रभावैर्वा मायया मोहनेन वा\nशरबन्धाद्विमुक्तौ तौ भ्रातरौ रामलक्ष्मणौ |",
      "iast": "yanna śakyam suraiḥ sarvairasurairvā mahābalaiḥ\nmoktum tad bandhanam ghoraṃ yakṣagandharvapannagaiḥ |\ntanna jāne prabhāvairvā māyayā mohanena vā\nśarabandhādvimuktau tau bhrātarau rāmalakṣmaṇau |",
      "translation": "\"That terrific bind of arrow cannot be released by any celestial or a mighty demon or by Yakshas the supernatural beings or Gandharvas the celestial musicians or Pannagas the serpent-demons. Rama and Lakshmana, the two brothers were released from that tie of arrows either by their power or by their sorcery or by their marvel I do not know that.\"",
