    {
      "id": "6.72.9",
      "label": "6.72.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "तं न पश्याम्यहम् युद्धे यो.द्य रामं सलक्ष्मणम्\nनाशयेत्सबलम् वीरं ससुग्रीवविभीषणम् |",
      "iast": "taṃ na paśyāmyaham yuddhe yo.dya rāmaṃ salakṣmaṇam\nnāśayetsabalam vīraṃ sasugrīvavibhīṣaṇam |",
      "translation": "\"I do not find any demon, who can destroy the valiant Rama along with Lakshmana, Sugreeva and Vibhishana accompanied by their army in battle now.\"",
